* Generic rail-to-rail op-amp macromodel used for TI OPA192 / OPA2192.
* Not the TI model: dominant pole (GBW, Aol), second pole (FP2), slew limit (SR),
* open-loop output resistance (RO), output swing VSAT from the rails, integrator clamp
* near the rails (overload recovery). Parameters from the OPA192 datasheet; see README.
.subckt OPAMP_RRIO inp inn vcc vee out PARAMS: GBW=10e6 SR=20e6 AOL=5e6 FP2=17e6 RO=375 VSAT=0.02
.param CC=10n
.param GMV={6.283185307*GBW*CC}
.param IMAX={SR*CC}
.param R1V={AOL/GMV}
.param C2V={1/(6.283185307*1e3*FP2)}
Bmid mid 0 V=(V(vcc)+V(vee))/2
B1 mid n1 I={IMAX}*tanh({GMV}*(V(inp)-V(inn))/{IMAX})
C1 n1 mid {CC}
R1 n1 mid {R1V}
Bch ch 0 V=V(vcc)-0.35
Bcl cl 0 V=V(vee)+0.35
Dch n1 ch DCLAMP
Dcl cl n1 DCLAMP
G2 mid n2 n1 mid 1m
R2 n2 mid 1k
C2 n2 mid {C2V}
Bo oi 0 V=min(max(V(n2), V(vee)+{VSAT}), V(vcc)-{VSAT})
Ro oi out {RO}
.model DCLAMP D(Is=1e-12 N=1 Rs=1)
.ends

* Current-sense amplifier: gain G, single pole BW, slew limit SR, output clamped to [gnd+5 mV, vs-VSW].
.subckt INA_BEHAV inp inn vs gnd out PARAMS: G=50 BW=1e6 SR=2e6 VSW=0.03
.param CN=1n
Bt t 0 V=min(max({G}*(V(inp)-V(inn)), V(gnd)+0.005), V(vs)-{VSW})
Bi 0 n I={CN*SR}*tanh(6.283185307*{BW}*(V(t)-V(n))/{SR})
Cn n 0 {CN}
Rn n 0 1e9
Eo oi 0 n 0 1
Ro oi out 2
.ends
